{
  "manifests": {
    "musikhood/auth-client-bundle": {
      "manifest": {
        "bundles": {
          "Musikhood\\AuthClient\\AuthClientBundle": [
            "all"
          ]
        },
        "copy-from-recipe": {
          "config/": "%CONFIG_DIR%/"
        },
        "env": {
          "AUTH_BASE_URL": "https://auth.example.com",
          "AUTH_PANEL_ID": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
          "AUTH_CLIENT_ID": "your-client-id",
          "AUTH_CLIENT_SECRET": "your-client-secret",
          "AUTH_COOKIE_SECURE": "1"
        },
        "post-install-output": [
          "",
          "<bg=blue;fg=white>                                                              </>",
          "<bg=blue;fg=white>  auth-client-bundle zainstalowany — co jeszcze musisz zrobic: </>",
          "<bg=blue;fg=white>                                                              </>",
          "",
          "  <fg=cyan>1.</> Ustaw zmienne <comment>AUTH_*</> w <comment>.env.local</> (URL auth servera, panel_id,",
          "     client_id i client_secret z panelu admin auth servera).",
          "",
          "  <fg=cyan>2.</> Stworz encje <comment>User</> implementujaca <comment>PanelUserInterface</>",
          "     oraz <comment>UserRepository</> implementujace <comment>PanelUserRepositoryInterface</>.",
          "     Gotowe wzorce do skopiowania:",
          "       <href=https://github.com/musikhood/auth-client-bundle/blob/main/docs/example-entity.php>docs/example-entity.php</>",
          "       <href=https://github.com/musikhood/auth-client-bundle/blob/main/docs/example-repository.php>docs/example-repository.php</>",
          "",
          "  <fg=cyan>3.</> Dodaj atrybut <comment>#[AsAlias]</> do swojego UserRepository, zeby Symfony",
          "     samo podpielo go pod <comment>PanelUserRepositoryInterface</> (przyklad w docs).",
          "     Wymaga Symfony 6.1+. Alternatywa: alias w <comment>config/services.yaml</>.",
          "",
          "  <fg=cyan>4.</> Dodaj firewall i access_control do <comment>config/packages/security.yaml</>.",
          "     Gotowy snippet: <href=https://github.com/musikhood/auth-client-bundle#34-skonfiguruj-security>README — Skonfiguruj security</>",
          "",
          "  <fg=cyan>5.</> Uruchom migracje tabeli <comment>users</>.",
          "     Przyklad: <href=https://github.com/musikhood/auth-client-bundle/blob/main/docs/example-migration.sql>docs/example-migration.sql</>",
          "",
          "  Pelna instrukcja: <href=https://github.com/musikhood/auth-client-bundle#instalacja>README</>",
          ""
        ]
      },
      "files": {
        "config/packages/auth_client.yaml": {
          "contents": [
            "auth_client:",
            "    base_url:      '%env(AUTH_BASE_URL)%'",
            "    panel_id:      '%env(AUTH_PANEL_ID)%'",
            "    client_id:     '%env(AUTH_CLIENT_ID)%'",
            "    client_secret: '%env(AUTH_CLIENT_SECRET)%'",
            "    cookie:",
            "        secure: '%env(bool:default::AUTH_COOKIE_SECURE)%'",
            ""
          ],
          "executable": false
        },
        "config/routes/auth_client.yaml": {
          "contents": [
            "auth_client:",
            "    resource: '@AuthClientBundle/Resources/config/routes.yaml'",
            ""
          ],
          "executable": false
        }
      },
      "ref": "f15d51f96eadeceb9f585c1fd0fbd6e7097873df"
    }
  }
}
